# BHU Email PDF Generator — Walkthrough

## Summary

Built a standalone single-page web application at `pdf-generator/` that generates the official **BHU Domain E-Mail ID Application Form** as a downloadable A4 PDF. The form layout exactly matches the physical form provided by the Computer Centre.

