## Features

### User Input Form (Dark UI)
- Category selector (Teaching Staff, Group-A Officer, Non-Teaching, PhD/PG Student)
- All 13 form fields with icons and clean layout
- 3 email choice fields
- Passport photo upload with preview & remove
- **Preview Form** button — opens a modal showing the exact PDF layout
- **Generate PDF** button — downloads a high-quality A4 PDF

### PDF Template (Exact Official Replica)
- BHU logo + "COMPUTER CENTRE" header + photo box (top-right)
- Strict HTML `<table>` with `border-collapse: collapse` for all 13 data fields
- 8-point undertaking section (word-for-word match)
- Dynamic declaration footer with injected name, department, designation
- Signature blocks for Applicant and HOD
- NOTE section at bottom

### Dynamic Behavior
- Category changes the form title (e.g., "Teaching Staff", "Group-A Officer")
- Quota label/value updates per category (20GB for Faculty, 5GB for Non-Teaching, etc.)
- Alternate email auto-capitalized
- Dates formatted as DD/MM/YYYY

