## How to Use

1. Open `pdf-generator/index.html` in a browser (or run `npx http-server pdf-generator -p 8080`)
2. Select staff category
3. Fill in all personal details
4. Optionally upload a passport photograph
5. Click **Preview Form** to review
6. Click **Generate PDF** to download the A4 PDF

## html2pdf Configuration
```javascript
{
    margin: [10, 10, 10, 10],
    html2canvas: { scale: 3, useCORS: true },
    jsPDF: { unit: 'mm', format: 'a4', orientation: 'portrait' }
}
```
